   "flags": {},
   "order": 0,
   "mode": 0,
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "MOSS-Image CharRef (early proof of concept)\n\n1. Load Image: one anime character, large and clear (full body or upper body). Scaled to ~1 MP automatically.\n2. Positive prompt, three parts: the prefix 'Same character and art style as Picture 1.', comma-separated tags for the scene, pose, framing and expression, and the character's own appearance tags (hair, eyes, outfit), e.g. from a WD14 tagger on the reference. The character tags keep the character much closer.\n3. Output size: Empty Latent Image, any size near 1 MP (1024x1024, 832x1216, 1216x832).\n4. LoRA strength 1.0 (try 0.8-1.2). Negative prompt stays empty; it still carries the reference.\n\nNeeds ComfyUI v0.42+ and the ComfyUI-MOSS-Image-Ostris-Edit custom node."
   ]
  }
 ],
